{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Host-less, Swift-Testing native assertion harness for InnoRouter’s navigation, modal, and flow authorities."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/InnoRouterTesting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterMacros"}],"title":"InnoRouterTesting"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterMacros"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/innoroutertesting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Tutorials","title":"Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/Tutorial-TestingFlows"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterTesting"},{"type":"text","text":" ships three test stores that mirror the production stores’ public API and transparently subscribe to every public observation callback:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationTestStore"},{"text":" — asserts ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStore"},{"text":" events (push\/pop\/batch\/transaction\/middleware mutation\/path mismatch).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ModalTestStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — asserts ","type":"text"},{"code":"ModalStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events (present\/dismiss\/queue\/intercept\/middleware mutation).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowTestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" — asserts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowStore"},{"type":"text","text":" intents end-to-end, including the inner navigation and modal emissions."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@testable import"},{"type":"text","text":" is required. The harness itself avoids app-side access"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to FlowStore internals; configure inner navigation \/ modal behavior through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowStoreConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Event queue model","anchor":"Event-queue-model","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each test store owns a FIFO queue. Every time the underlying store emits an observation callback, the corresponding event is appended. Tests consume events in order via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" or its typed helpers ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receiveChange"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receivePresented"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receiveIntentRejected"},{"type":"text","text":", and so on). A strict-mode test store fails via Swift Testing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Issue.record"},{"type":"text","text":" if any events are left unasserted at deinit."}]},{"code":["import Testing","import InnoRouterTesting","","@Test","@MainActor","func pushHomeLogsChangeEvent() {","    let store = NavigationTestStore<AppRoute>()","    store.send(.push(.home))","    store.receiveChange { old, new in","        old.path.isEmpty && new.path == [.home]","    }","    store.finish()","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment"},{"type":"heading","text":"Exhaustivity","anchor":"Exhaustivity","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default mode is ","type":"text"},{"code":"TestExhaustivity.strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": unasserted events at store deinit (or at an explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") are reported as test issues. ","type":"text"},{"code":"TestExhaustivity.off","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" preserves the ","type":"text"},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" assertions but silences the final drain check — useful when incrementally migrating large legacy suites.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"User callbacks are preserved","anchor":"User-callbacks-are-preserved","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you pass a production "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStoreConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ModalStoreConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowStoreConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" into a test store, every hook (including "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPresented"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onCommandIntercepted"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPathMismatch"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.) still fires. The test store appends events after the user callback runs, so production middleware and analytics pipelines behave under test exactly as they would in the app."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"End-to-end-flow-assertions","text":"End-to-end flow assertions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowTestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" subscribes to the inner "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStore"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ModalStore"},{"type":"text","text":"’s full observation surface and wraps those emissions into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigation(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".modal(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" events on a single queue. This lets a test assert the complete chain triggered by one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowIntent"},{"type":"text","text":" — for instance, that a sheet-blocking middleware prevents the inner navigation store from seeing any command:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let store = FlowTestStore<AppRoute>(","    configuration: FlowStoreConfiguration(","        modal: ModalStoreConfiguration(","            middlewares: [","                ModalMiddlewareRegistration(","                    middleware: BlockSheetMiddleware(),","                    debugName: \"BlockSheet\"","                )","            ]","        )","    )",")","","store.send(.presentSheet(.onboarding))","store.receiveIntentRejected(","    intent: .presentSheet(.onboarding),","    reason: .middlewareRejected(debugName: \"BlockSheet\")",")","store.expectNoMoreEvents()"],"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","type":"codeListing"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/Tutorial-TestingFlows":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/Tutorial-TestingFlows","abstract":[{"text":"Assert the complete chain triggered by a single ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowIntent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"navigation, modal, middleware cancellation, path reconciliation —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through a single FIFO receive queue, without mounting any SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Testing Flows End-to-End with `FlowTestStore`","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/tutorial-testingflows"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing/documentation/InnoRouterMacros":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutermacros","title":"InnoRouterMacros","abstract":[],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterMacros"}}}